Examples of bookler-links usage

* Tagged blocks by exact name: [[TEST_TAG]]
* Tagged blocks by wildcard: [[TEST?_TAG]]
* All tagged blocks in one editable list
- [[?:TEST_TAG]]
* All tagged blocks, not tagged by another tag
- [[?:TEST_TAG, -@notcooltag]]
* All tagged blocks, only is subset of files
- [[?:TEST_TAG, file:note2*]]
* All tagged blocks, sorted by tag context in defined order
- [[?:TEST_TAG context:THISFIRST,context:THISSECOND]]
* All tagged blocks, sorted by tag context && skip blocks with no context usage
 [[?:TEST_TAG context:amust!]]
 
* This block is tagged: @TEST3_TAG
// block taggin first

* Random stuff

* This block is tagged: @TEST3_TAG
// block taggin second

* TEST3_TAG-Tagged blocks in all files
// Peek: [[TEST3_TAG]]
// List: [[?:TEST3_TAG]] [[?:TEST2_TAG]]

* -TEST3_TAGTagged blocks in this file only: [[?:TEST3_TAG, file:this!]]